{"version":1,"content":"<p>【注意 ⚠️】是 TeamViewer 還是 TeamKiller !? 遠端桌面連線工具 TeamViewer 27 日承認，旗下客戶端軟體存在 8.8 分高危 RCE 漏洞，用家只要連上感染惡意木馬的遠端電腦，本機隨時會被入侵，讓黑客遠端執行任意代碼（RCE）或取得系統最高 Root 權限，官方呼籲全球用戶應立即將 TeamViewer 升級至最新 15.83 或以上版本。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:21:17.723133+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:02:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T01:58:09.627644+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:18:17.526950+00:00","content_hash":"7200edad71e7fbb67bc55cbe7313e8731815fff2b4318c54162002523fad5cb9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}